    -o compatibility, stage outputs safely, and expose five-second progress
    updates and structured conversion reports.
    
    Add parser, recovery, orientation, plugin, I/O failure, and native
    round-trip coverage. Relocate the regression models, update the
    regression driver, and document the architecture and converter behavior.

