commit 66a9e67399544774620868e6dc168862ece62810
Author: Erik Greenwald <erik@brlcad.org>
Date:   Tue Apr 7 10:18:56 2026 -0400

    Add rotate_extrude and linear_extrude support to csg-g
    
    rotate_extrude(circle()) maps to mk_tor (torus).  This recovers all
    1145 previously-skipped solids across the test suite.
    
    linear_extrude(square()) maps to mk_rpp (box).
