commit fd5d0062ad9f399611c28475511c34d06beebe85
Author: Clifford Yapp <238416+starseeker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Wed Aug 19 15:43:52 2026 -0400

    fast4-g bounds hardening, regression test w/ included Business_Jet model
    
     The unguarded pre-decrement loop `while (isspace((int)s->line[--s_len]))
     s->line[s_len]='\0';` could underflow the unsigned `s_len` (index wrap)
     on an all-blank line and walk off the buffer. Replaced with an
     underflow-safe form - no change for well-formed input.
    
     Also added a regression test exercising the smaller of the included
     faa generic twin models.

