commit cb632e1c4e98aeea033948ea6d18b73c5f3b9398
Author: Clifford Yapp <238416+starseeker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Fri Aug 14 10:34:04 2026 -0400

    Persist the key bext variables beyond setup function
    
    On the first run through of a configure, if we're building our own bext, the
    setup functions weren't passing variables needed by find_package up to the
    parent (global) context.  A subsequent run worked because then it was pulling
    them from cache, but the very first run through would fail with find_package
    failures (unless it happened to get luckyand find things elsewhere.)
    
    Fix is simple - let the parent context know the key values.

