commit 269e313603a85d8dbd5f8428e53c39d2c7ec17d8
Author: Clifford Yapp <238416+starseeker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 23 22:01:09 2026 -0400

    Enable librt geometry editing in MGED
    
    This is the cut-over of MGED's geometry editing from in-MGED
    logic to the refactored logic we have been working on in libged
    and librt.  The idea is to graduate CSG editing operations from
    MGED-only to being available to any libged/librt using software.
    
    There may still be some corner cases to shake out, since there
    are a lot of cases to deal with, but one of the major advantages
    of this refactor is we can now add automated primitive editing
    testing to our librt and libged suites.  We have already added
    a fair number of such tests, and we can expand them as needed.
    
    Conceptually reverts commit 71776518c5, but has many changes
    that adapt to more recent changes in MGED and add new features.

